Emoji name table (joypixels.tsv): generated from joypixels/emoji-toolkit
4.5.2 emoji.json (as vendored by KDE Ruqola, commit 9b849523), fields
shortname, shortname_alternates and code_points.fully_qualified, plus
the Unicode name in snake case ("folded hands" -> folded_hands) where no
shortname has it, for emojibase-style names.
Additional compatibility alias: check_mark_button (U+2705), the modern
name for white_check_mark used in Rocket.Chat message text.

